      <p class="entry-kicker">01 · THE IDEA</p>
      <h1 id="project-note" class="home-hero-title">Fails for <span class="bob">bob</span>.<br>Passes for <span class="carol">carol</span>.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Your quickstart works on your computer. Elsewhere checks whether it works on everyone else's.</p>
      <p>A quickstart (the steps a new user follows to install your project and get it running) is what Elsewhere checks on other people's computers.</p>
      <p>People from your community lend an AI agent that follows your quickstart on their own computer. When a step breaks for someone, your agent works out why and suggests a fix. Nothing changes until you approve it.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="primary-cta" href="setup.html">Try it yourself in 5 minutes</a>
        <a href="#run">See a real run</a>
        <a href="https://youtu.be/KfaLIlSxhq0">Watch the video (1:26)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="notebook-entry" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
